3	/// The row marks of the Clip inspector (road map 9 §5, spec §11 CI-7): what
4	/// the SELECTED action does to one row, in a 14 pt gutter before its label.
5	///
6	/// A row's mark is derived from two lists of `"group.key"` paths: the keys
7	/// its control WRITES — taken from the row's own `ops(read())` at build time,
8	/// so a write that lands on the action's end patch and one that lands on the
9	/// base props name the same key — and the keys it only FOLLOWS (Gain follows
10	/// Volume). Both empty is `.none`, action or no action: a row that says
11	/// nothing about what it writes (a readout, a Document-tab row) is never
12	/// marked ⊘ by omission.
13	enum RowMark: Equatable {
14	    /// Nothing to say — the gutter stays blank.
15	    case none
16	    /// ◆ — the row writes a key the selected action's end patch holds.
17	    case keyed
18	    /// ◆ and "at end" — the same, for a discrete control, which switches at
19	    /// the action's end rather than ramping.
20	    case keyedAtEnd
21	    /// ◇ — ANOTHER action keys it; the number is that action's time-order
22	    /// number (`ActionBands.ordered`).
23	    case other(Int)
24	    /// ○ — the row follows a keyed value without writing it.
25	    case follows
26	    /// ⊘ — the row writes the clip whatever is selected (CI-3, motion, a
27	    /// list's length): the selected action cannot animate it.
28	    case notAnimatable
29	}
30	
31	/// A section's marks, folded from its gutters: how many KEYS its rows write
32	/// that the selected action holds (CI-6's count, so a section's `◆N` agrees
33	/// with its sub-tab's), whether any row is ◇, whether every row that writes
34	/// is ⊘, whether the section differs from its default (spec §11 CI-9), and
35	/// the number of the action it is EDITING — the selected one, when any of
36	/// its rows animates — which is what turns its Reset slot into Clear.
37	struct SectionMarks: Equatable {
38	    var keyed: Int
39	    var other: Bool
40	    var allNotAnimatable: Bool
41	    var differs = false
42	    var editing: Int? = nil
43	
44	    static let empty = SectionMarks(keyed: 0, other: false, allNotAnimatable: false)
45	}
