698	/// The Color sub-tab's last section, **Look** (spec §11 GR-7 [b], grading
699	/// GR5b): the gallery of the eight built-in looks and None, the
700	/// imported LUTs and Import LUT… (GR-8 [b], GR6b), and an Amount row when
701	/// every selected clip has a look.
702	///
703	/// A tile (a LUT's too), None and Reset write the clips' OWN look in one
